  "title": "Testimony of Impossible Metals CEO Oliver Gunasekara Before the House Natural Resources Subcommittee on Regulatory Barriers to Deep-Sea Mining",
  "summary": "WASHINGTON, D.C. Today, Impossible Metals CEO and Co-Founder, Oliver Gunasekara, will testify before the U.S. House Committee on Natural Resources, Subcommittee on Energy and Mineral Resources, at an oversight hearing titled, “Deep Dive: Examining the Regulatory and Barriers to Deep Sea Mining.” Mr. Gunasekara will address the urgent need for U.S. leadership",
